### BTDig search - plain
GET https://btdig.com/search?q=due+spicci

### BTDig search - wget-like headers
GET https://btdig.com/search?q=due+spicci
User-Agent: Wget/1.25.0
Accept: */*
Accept-Encoding: identity
Connection: Keep-Alive

### BTDig search - tomagnet request shape
GET https://btdig.com/search?order=0&q=due+spicci
User-Agent: tomagnet/0

### BTDig search - custom definition headers + tomagnet query
GET https://btdig.com/search?order=0&q=due+spicci
User-Agent: Wget/1.25.0
Accept: */*
Accept-Encoding: identity
Connection: Keep-Alive
